message: "If you refer to these drafts, please cite them as below. They are drafts, not for implementation."
type: software
title: "SI Edge Open Standards: draft open standards for personal SI runtimes on user-owned edge devices"
abstract: "Draft open standards for a personal SI runtime that runs on devices the user owns: SI Edge Runtimes (SIE-RT), SI Edge-to-Edge Communication (SIE-COM), and SI Provider Profiles (SIE-PRV), with JSON Schemas, examples, registries, and a validator. Draft, not for implementation. No certification program exists."
